  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "景觀概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO LANDSCAPE ARCHITECTURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是介紹景觀的基本原理與觀念。其主題的安排，包括景觀美、人的感官及審美意識、景觀資源、景觀的構景元素、景觀的基礎調查、公園綠地、景觀與庭園、都市景觀、都市意象、都市設計、景觀與開放空間、都市景觀與市民參與、都市魅力的創造、都市景觀案例的探討等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the basic principles and concepts of landscape architecture. The main topics include beauty of landscape，the senses and sensuous idea，landscape resource，elements of landscape，basic survey of landscape，park and green space，land",
